<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>
Anti recoil macro for any and all weapons!

This consists constantly reset not only the vertical recoil, but also the horizontal recoil of all weapons. 

The lower the weapon's fire rate, less recoil you will feel. 

In addition, this macro also transforms any semi automatic weapon into full-auto.</Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 0 ms
MoveR -2 0
Delay 0 ms
MoveR -1 2
Delay 0 ms
MoveR 0 2
Delay 0 ms
MoveR 1 2
Delay 0 ms
MoveR 2 0
Delay 0 ms
MoveR 2 -1
Delay 0 ms
MoveR 0 -2
Delay 0 ms
MoveR -1 -2
Delay 0 ms
MoveR -2 0
Delay 0 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 0 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>